{"id":"8e128131c684b10c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-lachlan-noncomp.md","title":"非可计算 c.e. 集合没有 c.e. 模有限补元","display":"thm-lachlan-noncomp — 非可计算 c.e. 集合没有 c.e. 模有限补元","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-lachlan-noncomp","aliases":["20-thm-lachlan-noncomp"],"display":"thm-lachlan-noncomp — 非可计算 c.e. 集合没有 c.e. 模有限补元","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.14 的本地模有限推论","source_pdf_pages":[62,63],"source_printed_pages":[26,27],"depends_on":["[[20-df-lattice-re]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-lachlan-noncomp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-lachlan-noncomp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lachlan-noncomp — 非可计算 c.e. 集合没有 c.e. 模有限补元"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.14 的本地模有限推论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62</span><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}noncomp}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[|A\\cap B|&lt;\\omega\\land A\\cup B=^*\\omega].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}noncomp}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[|A\\cap B|&lt;\\omega\\land A\\cup B=^*\\omega].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有 B，从 B 去掉有限交集并补上并集遗漏的有限点，可得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span> 的 c.e. 枚举，令 A 可计算。原存在性命题是这个基本论证的弱形式，不能仅凭文件名归给 Lachlan 的其他非补元定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.1.14 的本地模有限推论；印刷页 26, 27；PDF 第 62, 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-lattice-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rec-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}noncomp}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[|A\\cap B|<\\omega\\land A\\cup B=^*\\omega].","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus A","display":false}],"bytes":1248,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2db5f72c1596f66e","550ce05cba351a42"]}